CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication

These animation files were generated using UniMate (https://github.com/Fannovel16/UniMate),
a text-to-motion model from Princeton/Berkeley/MIT (SIGGRAPH Asia 2026).

The animations themselves (the GLB files in this directory) are released under CC0 1.0:
no rights reserved, free to use for any purpose without attribution.

Note: UniMate's model checkpoints are released under a non-commercial license.
The checkpoint was used as a tool to generate these animations, but the generated
motion data is original output, not a derivative of the training data.

Generation pipeline:
1. Text prompt → UniMate inference (Mixamo skeleton, 60 frames at 20fps)
2. .npy motion → GLB via unimate2glb.py (rest-pose rebasing for retarget compatibility)
3. Runtime retargeting via retarget.mjs onto any Mixamo-compatible avatar
